🚀 Next Steps:
────────────────────────────────
  1. Review deployment:  terraform output container_details
  2. Test SSH access:    terraform output quick_ssh
  3. Bootstrap:          cd ../../ansible && make host-bootstrap HOST=<hostname>
  4. Base + Periphery:   cd ../../ansible && make periphery-install HOST=<hostname>
  5. Monitoring agent:   cd ../../ansible && make monitoring-install HOST=<hostname>
  6. Deploy services:    git push origin main

💡 Useful Commands:
────────────────────────────────
  • View SSH commands:   terraform output ssh_commands
  • View IP addresses:   terraform output container_ips
  • Show inventory:     cd ../../ansible && make inventory-graph
